# The Fast-parse / writer profiling harness (tools/ParseProf.hx), built out of
# `src/` with the flags the shipped CLI uses, so what you profile is the codegen
# that ships. Build from the repo root; the artifact is gitignored.
#
#   haxe tools/parse-prof.hxml
#   node bin/parse-prof.js tparse src 1 hxformat.json
#
# `-lib hxnodejs` is needed because `Sys` / `sys.io.File` on js come from it.
-cp src
-cp tools
-main ParseProf
-lib hxnodejs
-D js-es=6
-D analyzer-optimize
-js bin/parse-prof.js
